Okey first a couple of things: I have never ascendended. Second, I
asked for helping tips of how to play with Knight a couple of days ago
and I got tips, thanks for all of them. Some I used and some I didn't
use but nowadays Knight is definitely my favorite role!

After many quick deaths of Knights I started, Moholg Kni Hum Mal Law
went well. He fought his way to Sokoban, completed it. After that went
to mines with a brand new BoH and received a luckstone. Setting a stash
on level 8, going to see the quest but not completing yet. Going to
Castle and wishing for MR + reflection, completed the quest and the
Fort Ludios, now he seemed a great character. Magic Missile killed
everything with one hit and he also had great weapons (+6 Excalibur and
+6 Silver Saber).

The only loss on this game was when I wasn't thinking a lot and went to
fish for some food from the sea; I lost my most important spellbooks
there. Thank God Moholg found a new Wand of Wishing later and fixed
everything. Then began the long and boring phase of Gehennom, brought
no troubles at any point. After starting ascending with the amulet
everything went well all the way to the planes of Earth, Air, Fire and
Water. On Astral, where I have only visited once before (and died of
Pestilence) I had a feeling that I could ascend this time. Well, went
wrong.

Pestilence rushed in quickly, killed him a couple of times and started
my journey to the western part of the Astral Plane. Priests summoned
the place full of insects and all of a sudden I have a reincarnated
Pestilence next to me with all my spare amulets of life saving in my
BoH! I decide to take a chance and grab them. Before he gets killed by
a Magic Missile casted by an Angel of Moloch I have lost three lives.
At this point I understand that I will first have to  get blocked by
ants in some corridor so those evildoers won't get near me and heal
there. I do so, and then rush as fast as I can through the masses
towards the room where I have located the High Priest. I lose another
life on my way there when Pestilence does his magic touch. No problem;
I slay him there. But the problem is this: Death is right next to me
and has managed to lower my max hp all the way to 156! I start going
onward, Death follows (luckily he isn't faster than I am). I just zap
my way through ants and priests with my wands of death and move as fast
as possible, quaffing a Potion of Full healing here and there. Now I
will have to take a chance: There is a Red Dragon standing in front of
me, hp 56(90) and I zap my last wand of death for the last time... "The
Wand of Death hits the Red Dragon! You kill the Red Dragon!  The Wand
of Death hits the High Priest of Moloch! You Kill the High Priest of
Moloch!". Now there are only two priests and few insects left in the
altar room.

Two steps away from the altar, a Priest of Moloch is standing on it and
my only chance is to move towards or die by Death. I move, he kicks a
couple of times (three damage taken perhaps) and casts a spell so
wounds start appearing on my skin! I die.. DYWYPI?



So, to sum it up: One step away from the altar and died of a simple
spell by a normal Priest with maximum hp oh 63 (or 68, not quite sure).
I was all prepared for an ascension but no :(

